  "definition_ja": "同じ数を 3 個掛け合わせること、またはその結果。a の立方（a の 3 乗）を a³ と書く。",
  "definition_en": "The result of using a number as a factor three times, written with an exponent of 3, as in a³. As a verb, to cube a number means to raise it to the third power.",
  "latex": "a^3 = a \\times a \\times a",
  "spoken_en": "a cubed equals a times a times a",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "The cube of negative 2 is negative 8, because you're multiplying three negatives.",
      "ja": "−2 の 3 乗は −8。負の数を 3 個掛けるからね。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Find the cube of −0.2.",
      "ja": "−0.2 の 3 乗を求めよ。",
      "register": "written"
    }
  ],
  "collocations": [],
  "pitfalls": [
    "cube は「立方体」と同じ語（1 辺 x の立方体の体積が x³）。x³ は x cubed と読み、立方根は cube root。",
    "形容詞は cubic で、cubic function（3 次関数）や cubic centimeter（cm³）に使う。cube と cubic を取り違えない。"
